attribution: Music by Harry Armstrong (died 1951), words by Richard H. Gerard (Richard Gerard Husch, died 1948); published by M. Witmark & Sons in 1903 as "You're the Flower of My Heart, Sweet Adeline". Public domain: published before 1931 (United States) and all authors died before 1972 (Canada).
