melody:
# Refrain
Sweet Ad-e-line, my Ad-e-line,
D5 C5 F4 Bb4(4) ~Bb4 Bb4 A4 F#4 G4(4) ~G4
at night, dear heart, for you I pine.
Bb4 Bb4 G4 A4(4) ~A4 G4 G4 E4 F4(4) ~F4
In all my dreams your fair face beams.
D5 C5 F4 Bb4(4) ~Bb4 Bb4 A4 F#4 G4(4) ~G4(2)
You're the flow-er of my heart, sweet Ad-e-line.
A4 G4 F4 D5 Eb5 D5 C5 G4 A4. F4/ Bb4(4)

# Once more
Sweet Ad-e-line, my Ad-e-line,
r D5 C5 F4 Bb4(4) ~Bb4 Bb4 A4 F#4 G4(4) ~G4
at night, dear heart, for you I pine.
